      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Detective！来探求吧！\n在这个月里调查清楚吧──\n赛马娘的family究竟是什么样的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be84808959401412cfaa87326fb9f3208aa239d644b20bddb76c525705da947",
