      "uid": "zhcn:adbab7a25286751ea34a1a68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "采珠认为如果没有更深入地了解他们，\n之后在“阪神JF”中，\n一定会付出惨痛的代价。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ffb9d3201c557aa3312210c4d65cf4fb43a8dee04ee82e69c37d0e6f3235a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
