      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟我预测的一样。目白光明展现了\n与之前截然不同的跑法，而且──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3357c2810b499d95a3cac50caace092fc20e10c8dad816e0415883fe6cf5b780",
